### Rebuilding an invalidated slot — POST /actuator/cdc
# Runs on the management port, not the service port. Closes the engine, drops the invalidated slot and its
# stored position, and starts a new one at the current end of the log. Refuses a slot that is only behind
# (409) and needs the shared secret in a header (401 without it).

@host = http://localhost:1010
@recoverySecret = paste-the-CDC_RECOVERY_SECRET-value-here

### Rebuild the slot.
POST {{host}}/actuator/cdc
X-Cdc-Recovery-Secret: {{recoverySecret}}
